# Entitlement Management

## Overview

Entitlement Management governs access lifecycle management using access packages and approval workflows.

## Purpose

Entitlement Management improves lifecycle governance and access approval visibility.

## Security Benefits

- Improved lifecycle governance
- Improved access control visibility
- Reduced orphaned permissions
- Improved governance maturity

## Zero Trust Alignment

- Continuous access validation
- Controlled access lifecycle
- Governance enforcement